   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procsa&#x2019;s core activity is the development, design, construction and sale of housing units in Mexico City and the State of Mexico, most of which are classified as middle-income housing. Since its founding more than 55 years ago, Procsa has provided housing solutions for more than 16,000 families in the country.The operation with IDB Invest consists of a long-term financing program for MX$150 million. Its purpose will be to finance the acquisition of land for the development, construction and sale of vertical and horizontal housing in Mexico City and the State of Mexico as well as to provide financing to partially cover the company&#x2019;s working capital requirements.</narrative>
